          '## Ollama (Cross-platform, May 2026 + MLX backend)\n• Performance: Auto-uses MLX on Apple Silicon (only 5–10% slower than pure MLX)\n• Model support: Largest library of models. New models added weekly.\n• Setup: One-command install, works out of the box\n• Best for: Beginners and most developers. REST API for integration.\n• Trade-off: 5–10% performance overhead vs pure MLX',
